            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "In Graphic Design 2 (second year), one project required a 24″ × 36″ digital composition without print-focused production software."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I mapped the Sun’s lifecycle from formation to its theorised end as a black dwarf, using 8-bit game-asset tools for graphics and an AI-assisted editor for type."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    ],
